{"id":"01bd3231-fa1e-40de-91f6-9d3d54f0aa95","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"3bb7db9cb6b89264","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/tsval/capability-calls.ts","baseline":{"blob":"5a696823129e4ee15984fea4c83fc2bf0542e131","start":1513,"end":1654},"shape":{"type":"ExportDeclaration","atoms":["export","interface","CapabilityHit","{","\"","capability","\"",":","string",";","\"","resource","\"",":","string",";","\"","callee","\"",":","string",";","\"","dangerous","\"",":","boolean",";","\"","argIndex","\"",":","number",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"cb10958449659d91","after":"a6ceb63a7acca669"}},"payload":{"text":"A capability call the debugger (or the canary) reached: what it is, and the resource it targets (when a\nstring). `argIndex` is which argument carried the resource, so a caller with the raw args + the call node can\nrecover the observed value / static literal without re-deciding the capability.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:58:49.655Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:58:49.655Z"}
